        Legado and DroidFS applications. Their defaults/localizations are not identical,
        so leaving resolution to library dependency order can make one library display
        the other's wording. VaultShelf owns these truly generic labels at app priority.
        Product-specific resources remain namespaced and upstream-specific labels stay upstream.
    -->
